  <data name="Survey_AsociadoVote_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>This is a binding association vote. Humans verifies that you are currently an active, approved Asociado before allowing you to participate and again when you submit. Your participation is recorded to prevent a second vote, but your submitted ballot is not linked to your identity. Results remain sealed until voting closes. Submit only your own considered ballot; a submitted ballot cannot be replaced.</value></data>
